# 📘 TOEFL Academic Vocabulary - Day35

| Word | Meaning | Example |
|---|---|---|
| crucial | 매우 중요한 | Water is crucial for plant growth. |
| retain | 유지하다, 보유하다 | The soil can retain moisture. |
| adapt | 적응하다 | Animals must adapt to changes in their environment. |

---

## Synonyms

### crucial
→ essential / vital

### retain
→ preserve / keep

### adapt
→ adjust / accommodate

---

## Useful Collocations

crucial role
→ 중요한 역할

crucial factor
→ 중요한 요인

retain moisture
→ 수분을 유지하다

retain information
→ 정보를 기억하다

adapt to changes
→ 변화에 적응하다

adapt to the environment
→ 환경에 적응하다

